{"id":"63e851a45e23ff73","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-gl-derivation-principles.md","title":"Deduction and boxed-assumption rules for GL","display":"thm-gl-derivation-principles — Deduction and boxed-assumption rules for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles","aliases":["72-thm-gl-derivation-principles"],"display":"thm-gl-derivation-principles — Deduction and boxed-assumption rules for GL","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]","[[72-thm-gl-four]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 2, deduction convention and Proposition 2.1(a)-(c), printed p. 477, PDF p. 489","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source states these as readily proved; local induction and Lob-axiom argument checked","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-gl-derivation-principles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-derivation-principles — Deduction and boxed-assumption rules for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9f6dea82d265159\" href=\"?note=f9f6dea82d265159\" title=\"72-thm-gl-four\">72-thm-gl-four</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 2, deduction convention and Proposition 2.1(a)-(c), printed p. 477, PDF p. 489"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source states these as readily proved; local induction and Lob-axiom argument checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b98f8844a547104\" href=\"?note=2b98f8844a547104\" title=\"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability\">72-df-modal-assumption-derivability</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\">\\(\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9f6dea82d265159\" href=\"?note=f9f6dea82d265159\" title=\"72-thm-gl-four\">72-thm-gl-four</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m D\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m D)\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m D\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m D)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(A\\to_m B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(A\\to_m B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\Box_m D:D\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\Box_m D:D\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\Box_m D:D\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\Box_m B\\}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\Box_m D:D\\in\\mathcal F_m\\}\\ \\land\\\n\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\Box_m B\\}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式对 MP 推导归纳：假设 A 用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to_m A\">\\(A\\to_m A\\)</span>，其他前提 D 用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\to_m(A\\to_m D)\">\\(D\\to_m(A\\to_m D)\\)</span>，MP 步用命题重言式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to_m(C\\to_m D))\\to_m((A\\to_m C)\\to_m(A\\to_m D))\">\\((A\\to_m(C\\to_m D))\\to_m((A\\to_m C)\\to_m(A\\to_m D))\\)</span>；反向由一次 MP 得到。第二式也对推导归纳：定理 B 用上游定理集中的必然化，前提 D 对应 □D，MP 步由 K 完成。第三式先用第二式，再对每个前提 □D 用 4 从 □D 推出 □□D，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\">\\(\\Box_m[\\Gamma]\\)</span> 的全部成员。第四式先用第一式得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\)</span>，用第三式将这一推导内部化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m B\\to_m B)\\)</span>，最后用 Löb 公理及 MP。</p>\n<p>后两式只对全部为方框公式的假设成立；它们没有加入对任意临时假设无条件必然化的规则。原书 Proposition 2.1(a)-(c) 的 L 版本分别对应后三式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-four","status":"resolved","id":"f9f6dea82d265159","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-four]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-assumption-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"2b98f8844a547104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]] 的 $\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}B$ 和 $\\Box_m[\\Gamma]$。$\\Gamma\\in[\\mathcal F_m]^{<\\omega}$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-four","status":"resolved","id":"f9f6dea82d265159","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-thm-gl-four]] 的 $\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m D\\to_m\\Box_m\\Box_m D)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":